  "goodToKnow": "Der Kardinal is a senior Catholic cleric, one of those who elect the pope: die Kardinäle. The word also gives German its prefix Kardinal- for something fundamental: der Kardinalfehler (cardinal mistake), die Kardinalfrage, die Kardinaltugend. In grammar, die Kardinalzahl is a cardinal number (eins, zwei), as opposed to die Ordinalzahl (erste, zweite)."
